<title>ITALY: CYCLING-RUSSIA'S TONKOV WINS FIFTH STAGE OF GIRO.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-RUSSIA'S TONKOV WINS FIFTH STAGE OF GIRO.</headline>
<dateline>TERMINILLO, Italy 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pavel Tonkov of Russia won the fifth stage of the Giro d'Italia cycle race on Wednesday, according to provisional results.</p>
<p>Luc Leblanc of France was second and Marco Pantani of Italy third.</p>
<p>Tonkov retained the overall race lead.</p>
</text>
